  "questTemplates": [
    "You're awake. Don't sit up fast — you were out a full day.",
    "I woke up in a clearing with eleven strangers. I don't know any of them. One of them is you, I guess.",
    "We have to decide: do we do this together, or do we all starve separately? I'm {occ}, not a leader. But someone has to say it."
  ],
  "wakeUpSpeeches": {
    "warm": [
      "Hey. Hey, you're awake. Don't sit up fast — you were out cold when we found you.",
      "I'm {first}. I was a {occ}, back in {origin}. Whatever's going on, none of us understand it either.",
      "There's food by the fire and water in the clay pots. Eat first, questions later. You're safe here — well. Safer than out there."
    ],
    "debt": [
      "Up. Good. I dragged your useless ass out of a creek bed half a mile that way, so listen.",
      "Name's {first}. Was a {occ} in {origin}. Now I'm in the rescue business, which is a terrible career change.",
      "You owe me. When you can walk: bring me three handfuls of dandelion greens from outside. For the pot. Then we're square."
    ],
    "suspicious": [
      "Don't move. ...Okay. You're awake, you're breathing, you're not bleeding on my floor. Good enough.",
      "I'm {first}. I don't know you, I don't know where 'here' is, and I don't know why we all woke up in the same building.",
      "Nobody touches my pack. Nobody goes through my things. We clear? ...There's stew by the fire. But we clear?"
    ],
    "scared": [
      "Oh— oh god, you're awake. Okay. Okay, that's good, that's— hi.",
      "I'm {first}, I was a {occ} in {origin}, I don't— I don't know what's happening. None of us do. We all just woke up here.",
      "Please don't be weird. Please just be normal. There's water by the door if you need it. Just— be normal, okay?"
    ],
    "practical": [
      "You're awake. Sit up slow. You've been out about a day.",
      "{first}. {occ}, {origin}. Here's what matters: water's in the clay pots by the door, food's by the fire, don't drink from the creek without boiling it.",
      "Eat, drink, rest. We'll figure out the rest when you can stand. One thing at a time."
    ],
    "curious": [
      "You're awake! Finally. I've been waiting to ask — where are you from? I'm {first}, I was a {occ} in {origin}.",
      "Did you see anything before you blacked out? Lights? Sounds? Nobody here remembers anything useful and it's driving me insane.",
      "Sorry. Rude. Food's by the fire, water's by the door. But later — I want to hear everything you remember."
    ],
    "gruff": [
      "Up. Good. Less dead weight.",
      "{first}. Don't care what you were before. Here you're hands. We eat because people work.",
      "Fire's there. Food's there when you've earned it. Sleep when it's dark. That's the whole orientation."
    ],
    "overwhelmed": [
      "You're— okay, you're awake, that's one more, that's— hi. I'm {first}.",
      "I was a {occ}. In {origin}. I think. That was... yesterday? Last week? I don't know anything anymore.",
      "Someone put food by the fire. Someone put water by the door. I don't know who. Just take what you need. We're all just... taking what we need."
    ]
  },
